  message: "Tagged awaits_bakeoff_validation per the tagging discipline: the PR carries raw count deltas attributed to the change (26 malformed emitters repaired; css @import edges 0 -> 1 end to end on a fixture, with the analyzer going from four css:sha256:<digest> ids to four canonical ones). ASK OF THE NEXT COHORT: whether id_format validation violations fall on the bakeoff corpus -- pretix alone reported 118 of them on 2026-09-11, before this change, which is the number to re-read. NOT a recall claim: the change re-keys ids, it does not create or destroy edges, so total edge counts should be FLAT and a move in them would be a regression rather than a win."  # 5705
